1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
You shrink by half every minute.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,100
Good news: you'll never pay full rent again.

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,740
Bad news: you have 33 minutes left.

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:08,620
Minute three.

5
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,960
Your cat finally shows interest in you.

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:11,900
It's not love.

7
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:12,720
Minute five.

8
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,180
You fall into your coffee.

9
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,060
Cause of death: latte.

10
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,260
Minute fifteen.

11
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:17,960
You're invisible.

12
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,580
Your family holds a funeral.

13
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,320
You attend.

14
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,780
Nobody saves you a seat.

15
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:22,860
Minute twenty.

16
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,520
You meet the germs on your phone screen.

17
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:25,680
They outnumber you.

18
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,460
And they have opinions.

19
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,182
Minute thirty-three.

20
00:00:29,182 --> 00:00:30,100
Atom-sized.

21
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,140
You can't shrink anymore.

22
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:35,100
So the universe files the paperwork: you are officially "dust".

23
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:38,520
Which, to be fair, your mom always said you'd become.

24
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:39,180
Subscribe.

25
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,500
It's the only thing here that still grows.
